<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/> <fw place="bottom" type="sig"> <hi rendition="#g">Schwab</hi>, das kla&#x017F;&#x017F;. Alterthum. <hi rendition="#aq">III</hi>. 1<lb/>
